  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/671/671-3.htm",
  "statuteText": "671:3 Term of Office. –\n\nExcept as otherwise provided, the term of any officer elected under the provisions of this chapter shall begin upon the officer's election and qualification for office and shall end upon the election and qualification of the officer's successor."
}
